# Host-local Compose options, read consistently by every make lifecycle command.
# Copy to .ops.env and uncomment what this host needs. These are infrastructure
# choices, not application settings.
#
# Copying the file changes nothing. An uncommented line outranks the same
# variable exported in the shell -- and COMPOSE_PROFILES outranks a value in
# .env or a distribution's deploy/*.env -- while a value given on the make
# command line still wins.
#
# Attach the console to a standalone cloud agent's network on this host.
# CLOUD_AGENT_NETWORK=1
# Publish pgAdmin on 127.0.0.1 for an SSH tunnel (with the admin profile).
# PGADMIN_PUBLISH=1
# Optional Compose profiles, comma-separated.
# COMPOSE_PROFILES=admin
